     "body": "<p>I upgrade to Modeshape 5.3.0.Final and the test suite continues to pass for me.  Looking at the release notes (<a href=\"http://docs.jboss.org/modeshape/5.3.0.Final/release.html\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://docs.jboss.org/modeshape/5.3.0.Final/release.html</a>), I don't see anything that looks disruptive.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1167\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1167</a></p>",
